  "description": "Challenging emergent arcade shooting fun! Plan, time and bounce your shots, how large a combo you can score with a single shot.\n\nCan you 100% and 3 star each level? It’s not as easy as you think! \n\nWith every pixel in each level a dynamic physics object, the emergent possibilities for each level are endless.\n\nFeatures:\n• Synth-wave glitch styling\n\n• 42 challenging puzzle, wave and boss levels\n\n• 100% pixel physics\n\n• 100% real gameplay\n\n• Space unicorn that poops mines\n\n• Local high scores\n\n• Designed to be played on restored arcade cabinets",
  "description_short": "Synth-wave styled physics based 2D puzzle shooter filled with nods to the golden era of classic arcade games. Think upside down Peggle crossed with Space Invaders and enemies crafted from the blended remains 70's, and 80’s gaming.",
